## Publish Sequence

1. Package `dist/` folder → `dist/v{{N}}.zip`
2. Generate cover images (630x500 itch + 1920x1080 GH Pages)
3. Push to itch.io via butler
4. Push to GH Pages branch
5. Verify live URLs return 200
6. Screenshot live pages as evidence
7. Write `publish_manifest_v1` to memory

